# Tier-2 content reviewed for publication. Every hit below is a URL needed to call a public API,
# build a public profile link, or run an offline test. No third-party text, post or strategy is reproduced.
# Tier 1 (owner identity, brands, clients, paths) can NEVER be acked here.
scripts/jev_client.py  # The two public Jev API endpoints (TypeSafe direct, OpenRouter fallback). Endpoint URLs only. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/scrape.py  # Apify's public API endpoint, plus the public profile URL patterns for Instagram, LinkedIn and YouTube used to build requests. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/normalise.py  # The YouTube Shorts URL pattern, used when an item carries no URL. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/visuals.py  # YouTube's public thumbnail URL pattern. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/report.py  # The Google Fonts stylesheet link, public profile URL patterns for the byline, and a text link to TypeSafe on the "Labelled by Jev" credit. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/tests/test_pipeline.py  # Synthetic test URLs only (example.com and made-up short links). Every post, caption and id is invented. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/tests/test_config_and_tools.py  # Synthetic example.com URLs only. Recorded 2026-10-12.
scripts/tests/test_jev_client.py  # One placeholder example.invalid URL for a mocked HTTP error. No network. Recorded 2026-10-12.
